{"unit_id":"saul-dsh__dsh-siri-voice#feature-1","repo":"saul-dsh/dsh-siri-voice","commit":"e1b5bc1aaef3c43f8d02a7220caac6356c760419","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-siri-voice 的功能「录音波形与光带」：录音时在输入卡片边缘显示渐变动画，并在内置声纹位置绘制随麦克风音量变化的波形。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:286-510"]}
