{"unit_id":"saul-dsh__dsh-siri-voice#caveat-1","repo":"saul-dsh/dsh-siri-voice","commit":"e1b5bc1aaef3c43f8d02a7220caac6356c760419","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-siri-voice 依赖 DSH 内置语音输入 bundle 提供的 data-voice-activity 状态；未启用时不会显示视觉层或触发转写清理。音量动画需要浏览器麦克风权限，获取失败时使用合成动画。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:166-195","client.js:328-345"]}
